  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-19 (in session): the owner adopted all recommendations of the 11-19 review (three read-only research passes over the ADRs, the spec and the code; record ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/after_fast_smart_test_grouping.md). For this item:\nQ1: ties at equal rank_score order by entry KIND first (manifest-declared script, then a program start: main / main guard, then routes and the rest), not by detection confidence; amend ADR-0039 ruling 3 and spec ~L1418 accordingly (confidence is detection reliability only, ADR-0039 ruling 1; the 0.80 for main was set for ranking reasons). Separately re-derive main's per-language confidence from detection evidence. Re-measure the 23 repositories. Item 2 (routes just under 1.0): leave. Item 3: the sketch's per-group cut uses the same dealing (_take_dealing_ties). Item 4: the route-label dedup chooses by the full total order (see also WI-rorug). Item 5: _connectivity_fallback ends its sort with the total order; compact.py's tiered force-include is on WI-buvaf."  # 60e8
