  message: "Fixed in PR #2298 (merged to dev 308a326ad). Ties now order by entry kind: rank 0 manifest_declared, rank 1 main_function/main_guard/cli_main (PROGRAM_START_KINDS), rank 2 the rest; then the existing tie keys. ADR-0039 ruling 3 amended in place. main confidence re-derived per language from a 358-repository census (Go/Java/Rust/C/C++/C#/Kotlin/Scala 0.95, Python/Haskell 0.90, Erlang 0.50). Items 3, 4, 5 built (sketch group cut deals ties, route-label dedup keeps the entry-order first, _connectivity_fallback total order). Owner ruling 2026-11-20 fixed two side effects in the same PR: the library-export demotion counts only production entries, and a bare createServer counts as a route only when imported from http/https/http2 (vite keeps its 61 TypeScript exports); slice --entry auto applies the list's path penalty to its whole score (alertmanager picks cmd/alertmanager/main.go). LIVE REPRO on dev 308a326ad: hypergumbo slice --list-entries on the fixture ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr4/fupap/fixtures/q1_tie -> [cli_command] apptool (0.99) first, then [main_function] app/main.py main (0.90) second; before the fix main came 5th, after four routes. 23-repository before/after: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr4/fupap/RESULTS.md, out/COMPARE.txt, out/f3/COMPARE_F3.txt. Residuals filed: WI-jalom, WI-mulaj, WI-holud, WI-nihov, WI-dufuz; WI-rorug (label-only dedup key) stays open."  # e87f
